# Fees module

## Summary

The part of the member app the treasurer works in: every fee of the year with its status, the ones overdue first, and the reminder at hand. Described inside the app; built and run with it, never on its own.

## Requirements

- **UEBERSICHT** — The treasurer sees every fee of the current year with its status within one screen — from [tsv#Requirements[BEITRAG]]

## View: Beitragsuebersicht

### Label

Beitragsübersicht

### Summary

The fees of the year, overdue first, with the reminder as the action.

### Display

- Every fee with its member, amount and status — [reads](aim:tsv.beitrag.einzug#Record:Beitrag), [reads](aim:tsv#Record:Mitglied)

### Actions

- Send a reminder — [exposes](aim:tsv.beitrag.einzug#Operation:Mahnen)

### Layout

- Overdue fees come first, then reminded, then open, then paid.

### Bindings

- binds: `src/pages/Beitraege.tsx#Beitragsuebersicht` — as: component
